  "description": "Rate limiting the Orion family way: token-bucket and sliding-window algorithms whose refill/window math runs on an OrionClock TimeProvider, so a fake clock fast-forwards every window in tests. AcquireAsync returns a typed RateResult (allowed, remaining, retry-after), with OpenTelemetry by default. Wave 1 is the in-memory core; a Redis distributed store and ASP.NET middleware land in later waves.",
